SUMMARY:Raphael Ghanem LIVE at The Regent Theater
DTSTAMP:20260823T033710Z
DTSTART:20260823T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nRaphael Ghanem LIVE a
	t The Regent Theater\nBrazilian comedian and actor Raphael Ghanem brings h
	is hilarious stand-up show “A Carne Só Cai no Prato do Vegano” to The Rege
	nt Theater in Downtown Los Angeles. \nKnown for his sharp observational hu
	mor and energetic stage presence\, Raphael Ghanem delivers a one-of-a-kind
	 comedy experience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 23\, 2026 \nTim
	e: 8:00 PM PDT \nVenue: The Regent Theater \nAddress: 448 S. Main St.\, Lo
	s Angeles\, CA 90013 \nAge Requirement: Please check venue for age restric
	tions \nAbout Raphael Ghanem\nRaphael Ghanem is a celebrated Brazilian com
	edian and actor known for his unique blend of storytelling and observation
	al comedy. \nHe has built a massive following in Brazil and internationall
	y\, bringing his signature humor to audiences across the globe. \nWhat to 
	Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nHilarious observational
	 humor and storytelling\nOne night only at The Regent Theater in Downtown 
	LA\nA unique international comedy experience\nIntimate venue setting for a
	n up-close performance\n\nVenue Information\nThe Regent Theater is located
	 at 448 S. Main St. in the heart of Downtown Los Angeles\, CA. \nIt is a h
	istoric entertainment venue known for hosting world-class comedy shows\, c
	oncerts\, and live events. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $78. G
	rab yours before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale
	 Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a comm
	ission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. 
	\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be
	 required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/raphael-ghanem-li
	ve-at-the-regent-theater/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/raphael-ghanem-live-at-the-regent-thea
	ter/
