SUMMARY:2026 Brookwood Community Car Show Fundraiser
DTSTAMP:20260823T033713Z
DTSTART:20261107T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Rev Up Your Engines for a Cause!\nJoin us on Saturday\, Nov. 1 
	from 8:00am to 2:00pm for a Car Show Fundraiser like no other\, benefiting
	 The Brookwood Community! Over 100 jaw-dropping classic cars will be on di
	splay\, competing for exciting prizes and awards\, including the prestigio
	us Gordon L. Bisel Best Corvette Award\, Citizen Favorites Award\, and the
	 coveted Best of Show Trophy! \nCalling all car enthusiasts! It’s just $30
	 to pre-register your vehicle (or $40 on the day of the event) to get in o
	n the action. 1st\, 2nd\, & 3rd Place Awards for each class. Your vehicle 
	is registered when the Registration Form is complete and Payment received.
	 Use the links below! \nRegistration opens in September\nVehicle classes i
	nclude: \n\nGordon L. Bisel Best Corvette Award\nCitizen Favorites Awards\
	nBest of Show Trophy\n\nFor spectators\, admission is free!\nEnjoy a delic
	ious breakfast or lunch at The Brookwood Café (lunch reservations suggeste
	d via Open Table). Plus\, don’t miss the chance to grab some goodies at th
	e Brookwood Gift & Garden Center—perfect for some early holiday shopping! 
	\n  \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n
	  \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/2026-brookwood-community-car
	-show-fundraiser/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/2026-brookwood-community-car-show-
	fundraiser/
LOCATION:Gift & Garden Center and Café
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT6H
END:VEVENT
